  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Internally Displaced Person (IDP) Housing</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the project is to contribute to the Government of Ukraine&apos;s efforts to improve housing conditions of internally displaced persons (IDPs) by increasing the opportunities and options to access to housing. The project is primarily focused on Donetsk and Luhansk regions to provide long-term housing solutions for IDPs affected by the conflict in Ukraine.</narrative>
  </description>
